{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>A psalm of David. YHWH, hear my prayer</b> — the bet in <b>בצדקתך</b> is like the bet in <i>ענני במרחב יה</i> [answer me in the broad space of Yah]. And the meaning: that You show Your righteousness."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 143, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:42:33.461190347Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}